# Media bake

## Poster column (`attach_work_media`)

1. Dragged first-post image (`hero` / `PostMedia`)
2. Explicit `poster.url` on the record
3. Else labelled empty tile

Do **not** restore `poster_from_embed` or render `embed.thumb` in `.cb-poster` or link-card thumbs.

## Stage (`Embeds` + `embed_chrome`)

- `iframe?` → `.cb-embed-frame` with provider class (`cb-embed--gbooks`, `cb-embed--archive`)
- Allowlist changes go in `Embeds::ALLOWED_IFRAME_PREFIXES` (wired in `plugin.rb`)
- `curiobase-embeds.js` only strips Discourse oneboxes inside the card

## Google Books

- Prefer explicit volume id. Transient probe failures return `nil` (retry later) — never write `"none"` onto the topic custom field.
